# Frontend

- UI colors: VS Code Dark High Contrast — see `.cursor/rules/ui-theme.mdc` and `src/theme/variables.css`.
- One exported component per `.tsx` file; extract hooks to `hooks/`, map logic to `features/map/`.
- Use `import.meta.env.VITE_*` for config; never commit tokens.
- API calls go through `src/api/`; assistant chat uses `/api/assistant/chat`.
- Prefer small presentational components; avoid 200+ line files.
- Map is scoped to Karlovarský kraj (`maxBounds`); default view Cheb with panorama intro.

After edits: `cd frontend && npm run check`.
